            <div xml:id="d1268">

                <pb facs="0877" n="761" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg761"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 312.115/9.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Vice Consul Blocker to
                        the Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">J American Consulate</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Ciudad Porfirio Diaz</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1913-08-22">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">August 22, 1913</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Have been informed that Jesus Carranza demands by four p.m. to-day $50,000 gold
                    from Agujita Mining Company. Controlling interests is foreign. Have protested
                    but with small success.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">W. P. Blocker</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
